# NPC archers as the game has them today (docs/manual-aim.md, stage 4): four of a kind on an arc at 11, 13.5
# and 16 m shoot at the hero (immortal, still) with the dice; a bandit with a bow (40%), an addon bandit
# with a crossbow (60%), a paladin knight with a crossbow (65%). The cadence, the dice's chances, the damage
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_TROLLAREA_PATH_23
wait 500
clear 3000
immortal player on
still player on
cam follow 700 250 150

clear 3000
arc BDT_1003_BANDIT_M 4 1100 12
wait 300
stats npc BDT_1003_BANDIT_M talent auto
fight all player
wait 3000
rec bdtm11 novideo
wait 45000
stop

